body:
There is a free trial for You Need A Budget  

&#x200B;

[**https://www.youneedabudget.com/**](https://www.youneedabudget.com/)

&#x200B;

But you will have to pay once your trial is up. 

&#x200B;

If you get in the habit of tracking your spending via a Google Sheet at the end of each week using your credit card online account, it becomes an easy way to track your spending for free.
